=== phase 3: sufficiency -- patch ONLY these heads, no image patch
==============================================================================
  The mirror of phase 2. Instead of removing a head's contribution from a fully patched run, this INSTALLS it into an otherwise clean one: the image is NOT swapped, and the selected heads are forced to the values they took when it was. Necessity (phase 2) is the question redundancy breaks; sufficiency is not, so a small set reproducing the effect here is localization even if the knockout curve is flat.

